# Deployment - Kubernetes Architecture Template

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "Control Plane"
        APIServer[API Server]
        Scheduler[Scheduler]
        ControllerMgr[Controller Manager]
        Etcd[(etcd)]
    end
    
    subgraph "Worker Nodes"
        subgraph "Node 1"
            Kubelet1[Kubelet]
            KProxy1[kube-proxy]
            Runtime1[Container Runtime]
            Pod1[Pod: App]
            Pod2[Pod: Sidecar]
        end
        
        subgraph "Node 2"
            Kubelet2[Kubelet]
            KProxy2[kube-proxy]
            Runtime2[Container Runtime]
            Pod3[Pod: App]
            Pod4[Pod: DB]
        end
    end
    
    APIServer --> Scheduler
    APIServer --> ControllerMgr
    APIServer --> Etcd
    
    APIServer --> Kubelet1
    APIServer --> Kubelet2
    
    Kubelet1 --> Runtime1
    Kubelet2 --> Runtime2
    
    Runtime1 --> Pod1
    Runtime1 --> Pod2
    Runtime2 --> Pod3
    Runtime2 --> Pod4
    
    style APIServer fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0
    style Etcd fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#7b1fa2
    style Pod1 fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32
    style Pod4 fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#ef6c00
```

